<title>HONG KONG: Yue Yuen interim net jumps 91.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Yue Yuen interim net jumps 91.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   95.0     vs  68.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    20.0     vs  4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    629.86   vs  328.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		     5,279.72 vs  1,711.60</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yue Yuen Industrial (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Yue Yuen is a sport shoe manufacturer.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted due to consolidation of shares effective on March 28.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
